  "instructions": {
    "en": "Think of the past four weeks. When a relevant occasion occurred, how often did you experience what the statement describes? Choose the answer that fits your recall; if there was no relevant occasion, you cannot judge, or you prefer not to answer, choose unscored. These are original reflection questions about recent experiences. They do not determine whether you are a Highly Sensitive Person, measure how your brain works, or identify a condition. No activity or sensory exposure needs to be tried for this reflection.",
    "zh": "回想过去四周。有相关情境时，你多常经历题述情况？按自己记得的情况作答；没有相关机会、无法判断或不愿回答时选不计分。这些原创问题用于回看近期体验，不能判断你是否属于高敏感人、测出大脑如何运作或识别某种状况。无需为了回答而尝试任何活动或感官刺激。"
  },
